    <profile id="5ec4-34cd-86ab-296f-c5359" name="Ghostwalk Matrix" page="155" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A vehicle with this upgrade has the Move Through Cover special rule.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile id="e28b-fc50-8ccf-0b93-c5359" name="Grenade Pack" page="153" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Any time a unit with a Grenade Pack enters play by Deep Strike and does not suffer a Deep Strike Mishap, nominate one model in the unit immediately after it arrives. That model can make a single special shooting attack in the Movement phase with the profile below - this represents the unit's Grenade Pack attack. A unit that fires Grenade Packs in the movement phase can still shoot in the subsequent Shooting phase; however, it must target the same target unit if possible.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile id="b26e-5e9c-9c21-31ef-c5359" name="Grenade Pack" page="153" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48">
