    <profile id="78ad-d38e-67e7-2693-c5359" name="Heavy Weapon Platform" page="153" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">One Guardian from the same unit as, and within 2" of, a Heavy Weapon Platform may fire the platform instead of his Shuriken Catapult, counting as having the Relentless special rule. If there are no Guardians left in the unit, remove the Heavy Weapons Platform as a casualty. Weapons Platform models are ignored when allocating Wounds from Look Out, Sir rolls.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile id="a23a-87ce-2685-549f-c5359" name="Heavy Wraithcannon" page="149" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48">
