    <profile id="7839-aa34-8cfc-96ec-2adcd" name="Tanglefield Grenade" page="155" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
