          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>The Battlehost must include 1-3 Vaul's Wrath Support Batteries. All Guardian Defender units in the Battlehost may take one Heavy Weapons Platform per 5 Guardians in the unit, paying the normal cost for the additional weapons.</description>
