          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Once per game, as long as the Farseer from this Formation has not been removed as a casualty, the Eldar player can declare a Tempest of Blades at the start of their Shooting Phase. All Shuriken weapons in this Formation gain the Shred special rule until the end of the phase.</description>
