    <selectionEntry id="4e6e-fb2c-8c6f-f76c-2adcd" name="Collector of Ancient Treasures" page="159" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="afd1-c723-ab88-2714-2adcd" name="Collector of Ancient Treasures" page="159" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>A Corsair Prince with this trait may select any one item from any of the following lists, paying the noted point cost:

*     Artefacts of Cruelty (Codex: Dark Eldar)
*     Remnants of Glory (Codex: Craftworlds)
*     Enigmas of the Black Library (Codex: Harlequins)

Any other character model chosen as part of the same Detachment as a Corsair Prince with this trait may make any one weapon which they are equipped with Master-crafted for +10 points.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="4e6e-fb2c-8c6f-f76c-maxSelections-2adcd" type="max" />
