          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>The Corsair Prince gains the Corsair Combat Drugs special rule, and any unit in the same Detachment with the Eldar Corsairs Faction and of the Eldar Jetbike, Infantry, or Jet Pack Infantry type may take the Corsair Combat Drugs special rule for +15 points per unit.</description>
