, as long as a fearless character stays with a unit that is not fearless, he loses this special rule. If a unit that is falling back suddenly gains this rule, it will automatically regroup at the beginning of its next Movement phase, regardless of all normal restrictions on regrouping.


Note: units with the Fearless ability are subject to the No Retreat! rule.</description></rule><rule id="79d90ab0-ba2b-ae11-6958-48c37153b81b-6e468ff" name="Bulky" hidden="false" page="35"><description>Bulky models count as two models for the purposes of Transport Capacity. (7th Ed wording)</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="24a1143c-e7c0-35fb-073e-e55e45f28b53-6e468ff" name="Ancient Doom" hidden="false" targetId="e1ee54e9-46e1-48a5-268c-4956b2697149-6e468ff" type="rule" /></infoLinks><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="271501b8-4450-02e1-a907-6f173b28cae6-6e468ff" name="Wraithblades" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="349de5fb-167a-c81c-c8cd-f0fa4ced38c0-6e468ff" name="Wraithblades" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="model" page="36"><costs><cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="32" /></costs><constraints><constraint type="min" value="5" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="349de5fb-167a-c81c-c8cd-f0fa4ced38c0-minSelections-6e468ff" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint type="max" value="10" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="349de5fb-167a-c81c-c8cd-f0fa4ced38c0-maxSelections-6e468ff" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="f6005022-0348-4a9a-29be-d9dd0f948e38-6e468ff" name="Wraithblades" hidden="false" typeId="mh6-556e697423232344415441232323" typeName="Unit" page="49"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="mh6-5361766523232344415441232323" value="3+/4++"><conditions><condition type="equalTo" value="1" field="selections" scope="349de5fb-167a-c81c-c8cd-f0fa4ced38c0-6e468ff" childId="02f20324-7e3c-513f-e822-6176cb7d6056-6e468ff" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></conditions></modifier></modifiers><characteristics><characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="mh6-556e6974205479706523232344415441232